{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1228200-developing-a-combat-tracker-card","id":1228200,"title":"Developing a combat tracker card","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-06-17T21:02:19-07:00","id":1228200,"title":"Developing a combat tracker card","content":"Hi there, bless me Unconquered Sun for it has been many years since I posted. <br /> <br /> I'm starting up a 3e game soonish and I saw the need for having an easy way to track initiative and my limited search hasn't shown me anything I like much so far. <br /> <br /> We're all big boardgame players so my idea was to make an A5 laminated card with a magnetized back, and use a small round magnet for the initiative counter and use whiteboard markers to fill in health penalties, current onslaught penalty, etc etc. <br /> <br /> Anyway, <b><a href=\"https://imgur.com/a/NQewCv0\" target=\"_blank\">here is the current draft</a></b>, I'm keen for any feedback like stuff that's missing, stuff that's superfluous, and so on. <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1229925-hello-i-did-up-a-scavenger-lands-map-based-on-3e\" target=\"_blank\">3e Scavenger Lands map</a><br /> <a href=\"https://imgur.com/a/NQewCv0\" target=\"_blank\">3e Combat tracker card</a><br /> <a href=\"https://imgur.com/uGrZk2r\" target=\"_blank\">2e Nexus map</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1079-megapope","name":"Megapope","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1079_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"75"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-17T21:41:31-07:00","id":1228203,"title":"","content":"I think that looks awesome! If you have a computer screen everyone can see there's a few digital versions out there, but I don't think I've seen a laminated board version like this!<br /> <br /> My only thought is that, while not necessarily common, I've probably seen Initiative fall below -10 more often than I've seen it go above 30. But I HAVE seen it go to 62 once. So your mileage may vary.<br /> <br /> Might be worth having some method to track the number of rounds that you have been Crashed, as well as a place to note who Crashed you. Since after 3 full rounds of Crash you get you bounce back to base, and if you Crash the one who Crashed you, you get a Shift bonus.<br /> <br /> But that's just me. This look very nicely made!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-17T22:26:45-07:00","id":1228207,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b